@host = http://localhost:5217

### RESTAURANTS

### 1. All restaurants
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants

### 2. Filter by one area
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?area=Bole&page=1&limit=5

### 3. Filter by multiple areas
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?areas=Bole&areas=Piassa

### 4. Filter by maximum delivery fee
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?maxFeeEtb=45

### 5. Combine filters
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?areas=Bole&areas=Piassa&maxFeeEtb=45&page=1&limit=5

### 6. Get one restaurant
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/1

### 7. Invalid ID route constraint - should return 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/abc

### 8. Zero ID route constraint - should return 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/0

### 9. Restaurant not found
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/9999

### 10. Restaurant menu
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/1/menu

### 11. Existing restaurant with empty menu
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants/12/menu

### 12. Second page
GET {{host}}/api/v1/restaurants?page=2&limit=5

### ORDERS

### 13. Get existing order
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1

### 14. Get missing order
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/9999

### 15. Create an order - expected 201 Created
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "area": "Bole",
  "qty": 2,
  "notes": null
}

### 16. Update order status - expected 200 OK
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Preparing"
}

### 17. Invalid order ID route constraint - expected 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/abc
